Bouncy

It is an interactive build to play in the browser.

Its a black screen with nothing on it. Tap anywhere in the screen to drop the color balls they bounce on the floor and walls and after few seconds the balls will shrink and disappear, so the screen never gets crowded.

You can also drag the balls and throw it anywhere in the screen in any direction 

images are added in files type

How to Run

you can clone the git repo 

https://github.com/arunreddyyy/Bouncy-.git

Then open the files and open the html file and open it in browser and run it 

       "OR"

You can run it through the deployed link.

https://arunreddyyy.github.io/Bouncy-/

Built it using 
HTML , CSS and javaScript

I wanted to see how the physics runs in the webs.
